    {
      "title": "Grow a coalition through local decisions",
      "summary": "Each simulation step advances agents and then parties. After a delayed offer-collection period, a joining party adds mandates to its selected coalition and gains a cloned agent.",
      "details": [
        "A new agent immediately takes a step after being cloned.",
        "Execution ends when a coalition reaches at least 61 mandates or all parties have joined."
      ],
